DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->operators->undefine('+','-','*','/');

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

What is the value of [`14*10+18`]? [_____]{answer=>Real(158.),width=>3}
---

[`11+8+15+10/19`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(34.5263157895),width=>5}
---

What is the value of [`13+14*7`]? [_____]{answer=>Formula('111'),width=>9}
---

What is the value of [`6+16-18`]? [_____]{Formula('4')}
---

[`1+3-19*1`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(-15.),width=>9}
---

[`18+3+11-18*2`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>-4,width=>3}
---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
